(7401671, 1164429, 108069, '<td valign="top">A dream of a scene so ambitious in its construction that even the shadows can''t agree on the source of light. Up, down, diagonals all around; a person, two people, the same person. The fear of hitting bottom can be so strong that it can reorient your view downward. Climb the ladder.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1155933" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155933.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155933.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155933.jpg"/></a></td>', 'A dream of a scene so ambitious in its construction that even the shadows can''t agree on the source of light. Up, down, diagonals all around; a person, two people, the same person. The fear of hitting bottom can be so strong that it can reorient your view downward. Climb the ladder. ', '2015-09-02 00:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
