(7401747, 1164857, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great image Adam, congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Great image Adam, congrats on the HM!', '2015-09-02 05:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401748, 1164879, 25024, '<td valign="top">*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club*<br/> <br/>A good macro that meets the challenge in an amusing way.<br/> <br/>These insects are often associated with the title of the challenge regardless of the act of copulation they are involved in but its the voyeur photographer I blame he''s the worst of the lot of ''em! I love the iridescence, you''ve caught it well and your composition is generally good. The humorous intent behind the image has been acknowledged by your commenters and me too, thanks for the smiles.<br/> <br/>Where I think it falls down is the DOF it is too shallow. With an aperture of say f11 you would have got better clarity on the front wing of the rear fly and more definition to the other fly as well both of which would have improved the overall result. At f11 you would still have had a 1/125 shutter speed so it would have been technically and visually a better shot. You could also crop in a bit there is a lot of grey background that doesn''t really add anything.<br/> <br/>All in all, quite a good shot, thanks for your submission, Sid</td>', '*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club* A good macro that meets the challenge in an amusing way. These insects are often associated with the title of the challenge regardless of the act of copulation they are involved in but its the voyeur photographer I blame he''s the worst of the lot of ''em! I love the iridescence, you''ve caught it well and your composition is generally good. The humorous intent behind the image has been acknowledged by your commenters and me too, thanks for the smiles. Where I think it falls down is the DOF it is too shallow. With an aperture of say f11 you would have got better clarity on the front wing of the rear fly and more definition to the other fly as well both of which would have improved the overall result. At f11 you would still have had a 1/125 shutter speed so it would have been technically and visually a better shot. You could also crop in a bit there is a lot of grey background that doesn''t really add anything. All in all, quite a good shot, thanks for your submission, Sid', '2015-09-02 06:11:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401749, 1164968, 6519, '<td valign="top">I gave you the benefit of the doubt, thinking I might find out from your comments why you entered this in a challenge called "Dirty, filthy, grubby stuff". All I can see is a clean bird with lovely fresh, clean water.<br/> <br/>Sadly, I should have gone with my feelings, instead of the "doubt" bit.<br/> <br/>Nice enough shot. Totally DNMC.  :-(</td>', 'I gave you the benefit of the doubt, thinking I might find out from your comments why you entered this in a challenge called "Dirty, filthy, grubby stuff". All I can see is a clean bird with lovely fresh, clean water. Sadly, I should have gone with my feelings, instead of the "doubt" bit. Nice enough shot. Totally DNMC.  :-(', '2015-09-02 06:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401755, 1164625, 69324, '<td valign="top">Really nice image, no sense of being contrived with this one.</td>', 'Really nice image, no sense of being contrived with this one.', '2015-09-02 07:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401756, 1164516, 16912, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by romil:</b></div><hr/><i> Guess I got the name wrong but he sure looks like Jack :) congratulations on the well deserved finish! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought the same but wasn''t 100% sure hence the reference to the frog (Jacks last outing).<br/> <br/>Kees, congratulations on the HM :)</td>', 'Originally posted by romil: Guess I got the name wrong but he sure looks like Jack :) congratulations on the well deserved finish!   I thought the same but wasn''t 100% sure hence the reference to the frog (Jacks last outing). Kees, congratulations on the HM :)', '2015-09-02 07:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401757, 1164591, 96574, '<td valign="top">Had this picked at the winner.  Should''ve been higher I think.  Very good entry.</td>', 'Had this picked at the winner.  Should''ve been higher I think.  Very good entry.', '2015-09-02 08:16:43.000000', NULL, 0),
