(7401775, 1164552, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well the things people do for a ribbon :P<br/> <br/>I was trying for the life of me to figure out where did you put the camera, thanks for the notes.<br/> <br/> I have to admit I couldn''t stomach this for too long it''s really the most disgusting picture in the whole challenge and was obviously going to always get the blue! <br/> <br/> Congratulations.</td>', 'Well the things people do for a ribbon :P I was trying for the life of me to figure out where did you put the camera, thanks for the notes.  I have to admit I couldn''t stomach this for too long it''s really the most disgusting picture in the whole challenge and was obviously going to always get the blue!   Congratulations.', '2015-09-02 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
