(7401816, 1164911, 65858, '<td valign="top">This is a cool picture, Alice, of a place I don''t get to see often, being landlocked here in Colorado. :) Depth, texture, and visual interest are fab.</td>', 'This is a cool picture, Alice, of a place I don''t get to see often, being landlocked here in Colorado. :) Depth, texture, and visual interest are fab.', '2015-09-02 10:59:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401820, 1164625, 19825, '<td valign="top">I really like this image -- nice job on the portrait. Kudos also to your model as well as your camera for the surprisingly clean shot at 12800 ISO.</td>', 'I really like this image -- nice job on the portrait. Kudos also to your model as well as your camera for the surprisingly clean shot at 12800 ISO.', '2015-09-02 11:06:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401822, 1164993, 19825, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. You have been on a nice roll. I admire your portraiture skills.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. You have been on a nice roll. I admire your portraiture skills.', '2015-09-02 11:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401828, 1164968, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beetle:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave you the benefit of the doubt, thinking I might find out from your comments why you entered this in a challenge called "Dirty, filthy, grubby stuff". All I can see is a clean bird with lovely fresh, clean water.<br/> <br/>Sadly, I should have gone with my feelings, instead of the "doubt" bit.<br/> <br/>Nice enough shot. Totally DNMC.  :-( </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You don''t know scavengers very well.  They feast on dead animals.  Not only are they filthy, they contaminate the bird bath.  It''s too bad people are not more educated and open-minded about challenge topics.</td>', 'Originally posted by Beetle: I gave you the benefit of the doubt, thinking I might find out from your comments why you entered this in a challenge called "Dirty, filthy, grubby stuff". All I can see is a clean bird with lovely fresh, clean water. Sadly, I should have gone with my feelings, instead of the "doubt" bit. Nice enough shot. Totally DNMC.  :-(  You don''t know scavengers very well.  They feast on dead animals.  Not only are they filthy, they contaminate the bird bath.  It''s too bad people are not more educated and open-minded about challenge topics.', '2015-09-02 11:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401834, 1164993, 96574, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Congrats on your first ribbon Jeff.</td>', 'Very cool. Congrats on your first ribbon Jeff.', '2015-09-02 11:36:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401839, 1164955, 113411, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments guys. I shot these at Eastern State Penetentary and because it was in a very dark corner I had to go back for a different lens and I brought rubber gloves with me and ''styled''<br/>the mops a bit. They have probably been there since the 1920''s.<br/>They were really gross.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments guys. I shot these at Eastern State Penetentary and because it was in a very dark corner I had to go back for a different lens and I brought rubber gloves with me and ''styled''the mops a bit. They have probably been there since the 1920''s.They were really gross.', '2015-09-02 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 0),
